  "title": "Pioneering Innovation in the Commercial Space Revolution",
  "summary": "The commercial space industry is experiencing unprecedented growth, and TTM Technologies stands at the forefront of this transformation. Goldman Sachs forecasts the satellite market to grow from $15 billion today to $108 billion by 2035 in its base-case scenario, with the most optimistic projections reaching $457 billion. As the sector expands rapidly, the demand for advanced, reliable printed circuit board solutions has never been greater.",
